s #number`\r\n- [ ] Integration tests added\r\n- [ ] Documentation added\r\n- [ ] Telemetry added. In case of a feature if it's used or not.\r\n- [ ] Errors have a helpful link attached, see `contributing.md`\r\n\r\n## Documentation / Examples\r\n\r\n- [ ] Make sure the linting passes by running `pnpm build && pnpm lint`\r\n- [ ] The \"examples guidelines\" are followed from [our contributing doc](https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/canary/contributing/examples/adding-examples.md)\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/43188/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/43188/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1322105740","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/42532#issuecomment-1322105740","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/42532","id":1322105740,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5OzbuM","user":{"login":"hanneslund","id":25056922,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MDU2OTIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25056922?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanneslund","html_url":"https://github.com/hanneslund","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanneslund/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanneslund/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanneslund/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanneslund/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanneslund/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanneslund/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanneslund/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hanneslund/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/user